I'm afraid no such support exists. The config file can only control
using keyboard or keypad.

Think of it this way: The diagonal movement keys are in a nice
rectangle shape:
yu
bn

And the horizontal and vertical movement keys are hjkl, inherited from
vi. You can get used to them with some practice... and character
deaths ;)

Or if you're feeling adventurous, you can try porting AutoHotKey (a
Windows utility to remap user input) to OSX... AutoHotKey is open
source:

http://www.autohotkey.com/



